<%# Overrides app/views/donation_orders/show.html.erb.
    Theater Wit's donation thank-you page, word for word as it read before the
    copy was genericized. The house says thank you in its own voice and signs
    the page by hand, so this stays a whole-page override; the generic version
    says the same things plainly. %>
<div class="grid-x grid-padding-x">
  <div class="small-12 cell">
    <p>
      Thanks! You are 100% awesome. And probably 100% adorable. We've charged your credit card
      <%= number_to_currency(@order.total_paid) %> today for your
      donation. We'll also be sending you both an email and regular ol' snail mail message for your tax records. Please
      don't hesitate to call us at the
      theater (773-975-8150) or drop by next time you're in. We'd love to say hi.
    </p>
    <p>
      Thanks again, <br/>
      Jeremy Wechsler<br/>
      Artistic Director,<br/>
      Theater Wit
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
